"""Smart Weekly Grocery Agent — v3.2

Fixes in v3.2:
  - Completely rewrote price scrapers with correct, tested CSS selectors for
    Amazon Fresh, Whole Foods, Target, and HEB.
  - Added longer wait times and scroll-to-load for React/SPA pages.
  - Fixed Amazon cart automation: now uses the Fresh storefront search correctly.
  - Added fallback text-based price extraction using mac_chrome_read.
  - Store selection now falls back gracefully when all prices are N/A.
  - Added per-item retry logic (up to 2 attempts) for price scraping.

New in v3:
  - Dynamic LLM-generated grocery list based on fitness profile (cutting,
    201 lbs, 6'0", high protein) and Amazon order history.
  - Price comparison across Target, HEB, Amazon Grocery, and Whole Foods.
  - Items are GROUPED by cheapest store — agent orders from the 1-2 stores
    that cover the most items at the best total price.
  - Per-store cart automation: Amazon/Whole Foods via Amazon Fresh,
    Target via target.com, HEB via heb.com.
  - Hard $150/week budget cap — highest protein-per-dollar items prioritised.
  - Detailed summary: price table, savings vs most-expensive option,
    per-store subtotals, and items added/failed per store.
"""

